#: templates/about-us.html:11
msgid "Welcome to Faros Soundworks"
msgstr "Bienvenido a Faros Soundworks"

#: templates/about-us.html:13
msgid ""
"Faros Soundworks was founded and is led by Rafaelos Christofi, a "
"composer, music producer, and sound designer for audiovisual media, with "
"credits across film, opera, theatre, and other audiovisual and performing"
" arts productions."
msgstr ""
"Faros Soundworks fue fundado y está dirigido por Rafaelos Christofi, "
"compositor para medios audiovisuales, productor musical y diseñador de sonido, "
"con una trayectoria desarrollada en proyectos de cine, ópera, teatro y otras producciones, "
"audiovisuales y escénicas."

#: templates/about-us.html:14
msgid ""
"Throughout his career, he has collaborated with composers, musicians, and"
" creative teams on projects tied to leading institutions and "
"organizations, including the Dutch National Opera & Ballet, the "
"International Film Festival Rotterdam (IFFR), EUROMUSE, the Oviedo "
"Philharmonic Foundation, and Prime Video."
msgstr ""
"A lo largo de su carrera, ha colaborado con compositores, músicos y "
"equipos creativos en proyectos vinculados a instituciones y "
"organizaciones como la Dutch National Opera & Ballet, "
"el International Film Festival Rotterdam (IFFR), "
"EUROMUSE, la Fundación Filarmónica de Oviedo y Prime Video."

#: templates/about-us.html:27
msgid ""
"Faros Soundworks is a project dedicated to music composition, production,"
" and recording for film, video games, television, and other audiovisual "
"media."
msgstr ""
"Faros Soundworks es un proyecto dedicado a la creación musical, producción y "
"grabación de música para cine, videojuegos, televisión y otros medios "
"audiovisuales."

#: templates/about-us.html:28
msgid ""
"Our mission is to bring together outstanding musicians and deliver "
"orchestral recordings of the highest quality—combining artistic "
"excellence, cutting-edge technology, and a personal, professional "
"approach to every project."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra misión es reunir a grandes músicos y ofrecer grabaciones "
"orquestales de la máxima calidad, combinando excelencia artística, "
"tecnología y una forma de trabajar cercana y profesional. "

